    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.Email }}",
        "subject": "Leave Request Approved",
        "message": "=<p>Hi <strong>{{ $json['Full Name'] }}</strong>,</p>  <p>Good news! Your leave request for <strong>{{ $('Get Leave Application').item.json['Type of Leave'] }}</strong>  from <strong>{{ $('Get Leave Application').item.json['Start Date of Leave'] }}</strong> to <strong>{{ $('Get Leave Application').item.json['End Date of Leave'] }}</strong> has been <strong>approved</strong>.</p>  <p>Please make the necessary arrangements with your team to ensure a smooth handover of any pending tasks before your leave period begins.</p>  <p>If there are any changes to your plans, kindly inform HR as soon as possible so we can update our records.</p>  <p style=\"margin-top:16px;\">   <a href=\"mailto:hannahrazali@gmail.com\" style=\"background-color:#28a745;color:white;padding:10px 18px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;\">     Contact HR   </a> </p>  <p>We wish you a pleasant and restful time during your leave.</p>  <p>Best regards,<br> <strong>Ruby</strong><br> HR Department<br> Lilac Grove Kindergarten<br> <a href=\"mailto:hannahrazali@gmail.com\">hannahrazali@gmail.com</a></p>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        752,
        256
      ],
      "id": "45ff1c74-cbe2-4b35-b0df-a8092027c701",
      "name": "Approve Leave Request",
      "webhookId": "c4039d31-48f4-4c5b-99c3-75d761dd611f",
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "l1CeWcTnSGw8BPnY",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.Email }}",
        "subject": "Leave Request Not Approved — Insufficient Leave Balance",
        "message": "=<p>Hi <strong>{{ $json['Full Name'] }}</strong>,</p>\n\n<p>Thank you for submitting your leave request for <strong>{{ $('Get Leave Application').item.json['Type of Leave'] }}</strong> \nfrom <strong>{{ $('Get Leave Application').item.json['Start Date of Leave'] }}</strong> to <strong>{{ $('Get Leave Application').item.json['End Date of Leave'] }}</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>Unfortunately, we are unable to approve this request because our records show that you have <strong>not enough balance</strong> for this type of leave.</p>\n\n<p>If you still need time off, here are some options you may consider:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Apply for unpaid leave</strong> for the requested dates.</li>\n  <li><strong>Adjust the dates</strong> to fit available leave balance or split the time into smaller days.</li>\n  <li><strong>Use a different leave type</strong> if eligible (e.g., annual leave, personal leave).</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>If you’d like us to explore any of the options above, or if you believe the leave balance shown is incorrect, please reply to this email or contact HR directly and we’ll investigate.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\n  <a href=\"mailto:hannahrazali@gmail.com\" style=\"background-color:#007bff;color:white;padding:10px 18px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;\">\n    Contact HR\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p>We appreciate your understanding and cooperation.</p>\n\n<p>Best regards,<br>\n<strong>Ruby</strong><br>\nHR Department<br>\nLilac Grove Kindergarten<br>\n<a href=\"mailto:hannahrazali@gmail.com\">hannahrazali@gmail.com</a></p>\n",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
